# GOAL
Build a simple TODO list application for demonstration purposes.

# CONTEXT
This is a minimal demo app to showcase the Foreman Agent's build capabilities.

# STACK
- TypeScript
- Node.js

# ARTIFACTS
- `demo_todo.ts`: Simple TODO list implementation

# FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS
- Create a Todo interface with id, title, completed fields
- Implement addTodo(title: string) function
- Implement toggleTodo(id: number) function  
- Implement listTodos() function
- Store todos in memory (array)
- Export all functions

# INTERFACE
```typescript
interface Todo {
  id: number;
  title: string;
  completed: boolean;
}

export function addTodo(title: string): Todo;
export function toggleTodo(id: number): void;
export function listTodos(): Todo[];
```

# VERIFICATION
✅ Can add new todos
✅ Can toggle completion status
✅ Can list all todos
✅ TypeScript types are correct
